  "rationale": "Both localized answers are valid ordinary varieties-specific preferences, but the national split is materially overstated because the English form \"food court\" is also accepted and used in both Indonesia and Malaysia. The relation should acknowledge a shared synonym/common form. The empty contrast field also fails to state that this is not a false-friend contrast.",
